          "secNumber": "5.1",
          "heading": "Heaps",
          "content": "### Heaps\n\nA binary heap stores a complete tree in an array, enforcing a parent-child priority inequality. It supports constant-time inspection of the highest-priority element and logarithmic insertion and extraction.",
